 42 rivals, six Parisian clay stadium courts, and crowds that react to every point.\n{1004127365684421}\n\n{1447391470473611}\nFree to Try: every player gets a guest pass into the Group of 16. Lose, and try again, no penalty, just another shot. Win, and see what's beyond it.\n\n{2425097917899615}\n# PRO TOUR unlocks the full bracket: \nMPT 250, MPT 500, and MPT 1000, ending in a night final against Bastien Leroy, ranked #1. 12 Legendary cosmetics are earned only by winning rounds \u2014 not purchasable, not random.\n{1716630966328170}\n\n# Ranked Multiplayer with Leaderboards\nBattle AI opponents, train, or compete in Public, Private, and Ranked multiplayer matches. \n{1453026246821991}\n\n# Earn Your Career \nEarn XP, unlock 64 achievement trophies, customize your avatar and racket across four rarity tiers, and climb the Seasonal and All Time leaderboards.\n{1511494476508709}\n\n# Play on hard, grass, and clay courts, each tuned with distinct bounce and feel.\nOver 16 New Courts, Including Paris, Amsterdam, Melbourne, Rhode Island, and many more\n{1770756477226088} \nMatch Point Tennis is free to play. PRO is a one-time purchase unlocking the full tournament, private lobbies, leaderboards, and Epic/Legendary cosmetics.\n\nServe. Rally. Unlock. Rise.\nMatch Point Tennis.", "short_description": "Match Point Tennis is free-to-play VR tennis, now home to PRO TOUR: Paris Invitational - real tournament brackets, 42 rivals, six Parisian clay stadium courts, and a crowd that reacts to every point. Free to Try the Group of 16. Go PRO to play the whole tournament."}]}, "developer_name": "Backyard Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://backyardgamestudio.com/match-point-tennis/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Backyard Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://backyardgamestudio.com/games/match-point-tennis", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categor